<title>SRI LANKA: Development up 1.8 pct on fresh buying.</title>
<headline>Development up 1.8 pct on fresh buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Development Finance Corporation Ltd rose 1.82 percent or five rupees to 280, on fresh buying, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Fresh buying is coming into the share after investors, who kept away last week in the hope that the price would fall, realised that the scrip has firm support at current levels,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>DFCC is one of two blue chip development finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
